WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:02,240
Auntie, you want to change the salt, right?

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,740
Twenty packets per person first

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:23,600
Can these dry goods be exchanged for salt and sugar?

4
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,420
Can be exchanged for eggs and chili sauce

5
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:29,960
Can I switch to beef instead?

6
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:54,070
What to do when the funeral comes later?

7
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:56,740
Didn't the official send someone to distribute the meat?

8
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:57,740
Get me two more boxes

9
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:58,740
I have many family members

10
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:01,000
What are you doing? What are you robbing?

11
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,340
Who is your leader?

12
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:16,260
Believe it or not, I am complaining to you to be quiet.
